<section class="page-intro"><p>OTA, acente, doğrudan satış ve metasearch dağıtımını tek merkezden yönetin. Her bağlantıda stok, fiyat, kısıt ve rezervasyon akışının sahibini ayrı ayrı seçin.</p></section><?php if($message):?><p class="save-success">✓ <?=htmlspecialchars($message)?></p><?php endif;?><?php if($error):?><p class="login-error"><?=htmlspecialchars($error)?></p><?php endif;?>
<section class="next-module"><h2>1. Kanal bağlantısı ve ARI yetkileri</h2><form method="post" class="supply-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['supplier_csrf'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="connection"><div class="form-row"><label>Kanal kodu<input name="channel_code" placeholder="booking_com" required></label><label>Görünen ad<input name="display_name" placeholder="Booking.com" required></label><label>Kanal tesis kodu<input name="property_code" placeholder="Örn. 123456"></label></div><fieldset><legend>NEXUS’un yöneteceği akışlar</legend><label><input type="checkbox" name="availability" checked> Kontenjan</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="rates" checked> Fiyat</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="restrictions" checked> Kısıtlar</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="reservations" checked> Rezervasyon alımı</label></fieldset><button>Bağlantı taslağını kaydet</button></form><?php foreach($connections as $c):$s=json_decode($c['sync_scopes']??'{}',true)?:[];?><article class="conn-block <?= $c['status']==='error' ? 'conn-error' : '' ?>"><?php if($c['status']==='error'):?><span class="conn-err-badge">⚠ HATA — bağlantı çalışmıyor</span><?php endif;?><p><b><?=htmlspecialchars($c['display_name'])?></b> · <?=htmlspecialchars($c['status'])?> · <?=implode(', ',array_keys(array_filter($s)))?:'akış seçilmedi'?> · son durum: <?=htmlspecialchars($c['last_sync_status'])?><?= $c['last_error'] ? ' · <span style="color:#b0301a">Son hata: ' . htmlspecialchars($c['last_error']) . '</span>' : '' ?></p><div class="ical-url-box"><span class="ical-url-label" title="https://nexustraveltech.com/api/channel-webhook?token=<?=htmlspecialchars($c['access_token'])?>">api/channel-webhook?token=<?=htmlspecialchars(substr($c['access_token'],0,10))?>…<?=htmlspecialchars(substr($c['access_token'],30,4))?>…</span><button type="button" class="ical-copy-btn" data-copy="https://nexustraveltech.com/api/channel-webhook?token=<?=htmlspecialchars($c['access_token'])?>">Kopyala</button></div><p class="conn-hint">Kanal tarafına bildirimler için bu webhook adresini verin. Bağlantı aktif olduğunda gönderilen JSON bildirimleri işlem günlüğünde görünür.</p></article><?php endforeach;?></section>
<section class="next-module"><h2>2. Ürün eşleştirmesi</h2><p>Bağlantı aktifleştirilmeden önce NEXUS ürününüzü kanalın tesis koduna bağlayın. Oda eşleştirmeleri sonraki adımda (bölüm 3) yapılır.</p><form method="post" class="supply-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['supplier_csrf'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="property_map"><div class="form-row"><label>Kanal<select name="connection_id"><?php foreach($connections as $c):?><option value="<?=$c['id']?>"><?=htmlspecialchars($c['display_name'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>NEXUS ürünü<select name="property_id"><?php foreach($properties as $p):?><option value="<?=$p['id']?>"><?=htmlspecialchars($p['name'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>Kanal ürün kodu<input name="external_property_id" required></label></div><button>Eşleştirmeyi kaydet</button></form><?php foreach($mappings as $m):?><p><b><?=htmlspecialchars($m['display_name'])?></b> · <?=htmlspecialchars($m['property_name'])?> → <?=htmlspecialchars($m['external_property_id'])?></p><?php endforeach;?></section>
<section class="next-module"><h2>3. Oda eşleştirmesi</h2><p>Kanalın webhook bildirimlerinde gönderdiği <b>dış oda kodu</b> ile NEXUS oda/birim tipini eşleştirin. Fiyat, kontenjan, kısıt ve rezervasyon bildirimleri doğru oda tipine yazılır. <b>Tanınmayan kod</b> (kontrol merkezi ayarı açıkken) ilk aktif oda tipine yazılmaz — aşağıda <b>onay bekleyen öneri</b> olarak listelenir; onaylanınca o koda ait satırlar yazılmaya başlar.</p><form method="post" class="supply-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['supplier_csrf'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="room_map_edit"><div class="form-row"><label>Kanal<select name="connection_id"><?php foreach($connections as $c):?><option value="<?=$c['id']?>"><?=htmlspecialchars($c['display_name'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>NEXUS ürünü<select name="property_id"><?php foreach($properties as $p):?><option value="<?=$p['id']?>"><?=htmlspecialchars($p['name'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label></div><button>Eşleştirmeleri düzenle →</button></form><?php if(!empty($roomEdit)): $rmq=$pdo->prepare('SELECT id, room_type_id, external_room_id, status, suggestion_count, suggested_at FROM channel_room_mappings WHERE channel_connection_id=? AND property_id=? ORDER BY (status=\'suggested\') DESC, id');$rmq->execute([$roomEdit['connection_id'],$roomEdit['property_id']]);$mapByRoom=[];$suggestions=[];$suggestedRooms=[];foreach($rmq->fetchAll() as $mr){$mapByRoom[(int)$mr['room_type_id']]=$mr['external_room_id'];if($mr['status']==='suggested'){$suggestions[]=$mr;$suggestedRooms[(int)$mr['room_type_id']]=true;}}$rq=$pdo->prepare('SELECT id,name,status FROM room_types WHERE property_id=? ORDER BY name');$rq->execute([$roomEdit['property_id']]);$roomRows=$rq->fetchAll();$roomNames=[];foreach($roomRows as $rr)$roomNames[(int)$rr['id']]=$rr['name'];$connName='';foreach($connections as $c)if((int)$c['id']===(int)$roomEdit['connection_id'])$connName=$c['display_name'];?><?php if($suggestions):?><div class="room-suggestions"><h3>⏳ Onay bekleyen eşleştirme önerileri</h3><p class="conn-hint">Webhook'ta tanınmayan dış oda kodu geldi; veri onaylanana kadar yazılmadı. <b>Onayla</b> → kod bundan sonra seçili oda tipine yazılır; <b>Reddet</b> → öneri düşer. Farklı bir oda tipine bağlamak için aşağıdaki formdan kod yazıp kaydedin (otomatik onaylanır).</p><?php foreach($suggestions as $sg):?><div class="room-suggestion-wrap" data-verify-box><div class="room-suggestion-row"><div><b><?=htmlspecialchars($sg['external_room_id'])?></b><span>→ <?=htmlspecialchars($roomNames[(int)$sg['room_type_id']]??('#'.(int)$sg['room_type_id']))?> · <?=(int)$sg['suggestion_count']?> bildirim · son öneri <?=htmlspecialchars((string)($sg['suggested_at']??''))?></span></div><div class="room-suggestion-actions"><button type="button" class="room-verify-btn" data-conn="<?=(int)$roomEdit['connection_id']?>" data-prop="<?=(int)$roomEdit['property_id']?>" data-code="<?=htmlspecialchars($sg['external_room_id'])?>">Doğrula</button><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['supplier_csrf'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="room_map_approve"><input type="hidden" name="mapping_id" value="<?=(int)$sg['id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="connection_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['connection_id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="property_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['property_id']?>"><button>Onayla ✓</button></form><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['supplier_csrf'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="room_map_reject"><input type="hidden" name="mapping_id" value="<?=(int)$sg['id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="connection_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['connection_id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="property_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['property_id']?>"><button class="danger-btn">Reddet ✕</button></form></div></div><div class="room-verify-result" hidden></div></div><?php endforeach;?></div><?php endif;?><?php $seen=$pdo->prepare("SELECT request_payload FROM channel_sync_logs WHERE channel_connection_id=? AND property_id=? AND direction='pull' AND request_payload IS NOT NULL ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 30");$seen->execute([$roomEdit['connection_id'],$roomEdit['property_id']]);$seenCodes=[];foreach($seen->fetchAll() as $sl){$dec=json_decode((string)$sl['request_payload'],true);if(!is_array($dec)||!isset($dec['entries'])||!is_array($dec['entries']))continue;foreach($dec['entries'] as $en){if(is_array($en)&&isset($en['external_room_id'])&&trim((string)$en['external_room_id'])!=='')$seenCodes[trim((string)$en['external_room_id'])]=true;}}$unmatched=[];if($seenCodes){$pl=$pdo->prepare('SELECT external_room_id FROM channel_room_mappings WHERE channel_connection_id=? AND property_id=?');$pl->execute([$roomEdit['connection_id'],$roomEdit['property_id']]);$mappedCodes=[];foreach($pl->fetchAll(PDO::FETCH_COLUMN) as $mc)$mappedCodes[$mc]=true;foreach(array_keys($seenCodes) as $code)if(!isset($mappedCodes[$code]))$unmatched[]=$code;}?><?php if($unmatched):?><div class="room-unmatched"><h3>🔍 Son 30 işlemde görülen eşleşmemiş kodlar</h3><p class="conn-hint">Bu kanaldan gelen son 30 bildirimde şu dış kodlar geçti ama <b>hiçbir NEXUS oda tipine eşleştirilmedi</b>; aşağıdaki formdan bir oda tipine yazıp kaydederseniz otomatik onaylanır. (Onay bekleyen öneriler üstte ayrıca listelenir.)</p><div class="room-unmatched-codes"><?php foreach($unmatched as $uc):?><span class="room-unmatched-chip"><?=htmlspecialchars($uc)?></span><?php endforeach;?></div></div><?php endif;?><form method="post" class="supply-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['supplier_csrf'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="room_map_save"><input type="hidden" name="connection_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['connection_id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="property_id" value="<?=(int)$roomEdit['property_id']?>"><h3><?=htmlspecialchars($connName)?> → oda eşleştirmeleri</h3><p class="conn-hint">Her NEXUS oda tipine kanalın kullandığı dış kodu yazın; boş bırakılan satır eşleşmeyi kaldırır. Aynı dış kod iki oda tipine verilemez; buradan kaydedilen her satır onaylı kabul edilir.</p><?php foreach($roomRows as $r):$rowCode=(string)($mapByRoom[(int)$r['id']]??'');?><div class="room-map-wrap" data-verify-box><div class="room-map-row"><label><?=htmlspecialchars($r['name'])?><?= $r['status']==='active'?'':' <small>('.$r['status'].')</small>' ?><?= isset($suggestedRooms[(int)$r['id']])?' <small class="sug-badge">öneri bekliyor</small>':'' ?></label><input name="rooms[<?=(int)$r['id']?>]" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($rowCode)?>" placeholder="Kanal oda kodu — Örn. OTA-DELUXE"><?php if($rowCode!==''):?><button type="button" class="room-verify-btn" data-conn="<?=(int)$roomEdit['connection_id']?>" data-prop="<?=(int)$roomEdit['property_id']?>" data-code="<?=htmlspecialchars($rowCode)?>">Doğrula</button><?php endif;?></div><div class="room-verify-result" hidden></div></div><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$roomRows):?><p style="color:#6b7774">Bu üründe henüz oda/birim tipi yok — önce ilan düzenleyiciden ekleyin.</p><?php endif;?><button>Eşleştirmeleri kaydet →</button></form><?php endif;?></section>
<section class="next-module"><h2>4. Gönderim kuyruğu & işlem günlüğü</h2><form method="post" class="supply-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['supplier_csrf'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="queue"><div class="form-row"><label>Kanal<select name="connection_id"><?php foreach($connections as $c):?><option value="<?=$c['id']?>"><?=htmlspecialchars($c['display_name'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>Gönderim türü<select name="scope"><option value="availability">Kontenjan</option><option value="rates">Fiyat</option><option value="restrictions">Kısıtlar</option><option value="content">İlan içeriği</option></select></label></div><button>Manuel senkronizasyon başlat</button></form><?php foreach($logs as $log):?><p><b><?=htmlspecialchars($log['display_name'])?></b> · <?=htmlspecialchars($log['direction'])?> / <?=htmlspecialchars($log['scope'])?> · <strong><?=htmlspecialchars($log['status'])?></strong> · <?=htmlspecialchars($log['created_at'])?> <?= $log['error_message']?'· '.htmlspecialchars($log['error_message']):''?></p><?php endforeach;?></section><script>function fallbackCopy(text){var ta=document.createElement('textarea');ta.value=text;ta.style.position='fixed';ta.style.opacity='0';document.body.appendChild(ta);ta.select();try{document.execCommand('copy')}catch(e){}document.body.removeChild(ta)}document.querySelectorAll('.ical-copy-btn').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){var url=this.getAttribute('data-copy'),btn=this;function done(){btn.textContent='Kopyalandı ✓';btn.classList.add('copied');setTimeout(function(){btn.textContent='Kopyala';btn.classList.remove('copied')},1600)}if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){navigator.clipboard.writeText(url).then(done).catch(function(){fallbackCopy(url);done()})}else{fallbackCopy(url);done()}})});document.querySelectorAll('.room-verify-btn').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){var btn=this,box=btn.closest('[data-verify-box]');if(!box)return;var res=box.querySelector('.room-verify-result');if(btn.dataset.loading)return;btn.dataset.loading='1';var old=btn.textContent;btn.textContent='…';btn.disabled=true;fetch('/nexustraveltech/api/supplier-room-verify.php?connection_id='+encodeURIComponent(btn.dataset.conn)+'&property_id='+encodeURIComponent(btn.dataset.prop)+'&code='+encodeURIComponent(btn.dataset.code),{credentials:'same-origin'}).then(function(r){return r.json()}).then(function(d){btn.textContent=old;btn.disabled=false;delete btn.dataset.loading;if(!d.ok){res.textContent=d.message||'Hata';res.className='room-verify-result err';res.hidden=false;return}if(!d.found){res.textContent=d.message||'Bu kod için webhook kaydı yok.';res.className='room-verify-result';res.hidden=false;return}var e=d.entry||{},parts=['#'+d.log.id+' · '+d.log.scope+' · '+d.log.status+(d.log.error_message?' · hata: '+d.log.error_message:'')+' · '+d.log.created_at];if(e.date)parts.push('tarih: '+e.date);if(e.price!==undefined&&e.price!==null&&e.price!=='')parts.push('fiyat: '+e.price+(e.currency?' '+e.currency:''));if(e.allotment!==undefined&&e.allotment!==null)parts.push('kontenjan: '+e.allotment);if(e.stop_sale!==undefined)parts.push('satış kapalı: '+(e.stop_sale?'evet':'hayır'));if(e.min_stay!==undefined)parts.push('min konaklama: '+e.min_stay);if(e.max_stay!==undefined&&e.max_stay!==null)parts.push('max konaklama: '+e.max_stay);res.textContent=parts.join(' · ');res.className='room-verify-result'+(d.log.status==='failed'?' err':'');res.hidden=false}).catch(function(){btn.textContent=old;btn.disabled=false;delete btn.dataset.loading;res.textContent='Doğrulama yapılamadı (ağ/oturum).';res.className='room-verify-result err';res.hidden=false})})});</script><?php supply_end();
